📊 **Online Store Annual Report 2022 | Data Analytics Project**

I'm excited to share my Online Store Annual Report 2022 dashboard, a data analytics project focused on understanding sales performance, customer demographics, order trends, and sales channels.

🔍 **Key Insights:**
- 👩 Women contributed 64% of sales compared with 36% for men.
- 🛒 Amazon was the leading sales channel, contributing 35% of orders.
- 📍 Maharashtra recorded the highest sales at approximately 2.99M.
- 📦 92% of orders were delivered, according to the displayed order-status distribution.
- 📈 March recorded the highest monthly sales and order activity in the dashboard.
- 🎯 Customer age and gender analysis can help businesses improve audience targeting.

🛠️ **Tools Used:** Microsoft Excel, Pivot Tables, Charts, Slicers, and Interactive Dashboard Design.

💡 **What I learned:** This project helped me strengthen my skills in data analysis, data visualization, KPI monitoring, and converting raw data into actionable business insights.

My goal is to turn data into meaningful insights that support better business decisions.

I'm continuously learning and building projects as I work toward my career in Data Analytics.

